{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 3, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the land of the Rising Sun! A journey most grand awaits thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Light**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate a wondrous sight behold.\nThy luggage claim thou shall then find.\nTo Shinjuku's heart proceed with haste.\nA hotel chosen fit for a king or queen.\nDinner partake of ramen so fine.\nThen wander streets alight with neon glow.\nA spectacle for eyes to behold.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Tradition**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall go.\nSenso-ji grand its beauty untold.\nThen explore Nakamise-dori's stalls.\nWhere trinkets sweet and treasures enthrall.\nAfternoon find respite in Ueno Park.\nMuseums grand a peaceful ark.\nEvening traverse Shibuya's crossing bold.\nA human river stories to unfold.\n\n**Day Three: Culture and Craft**\n\nTo Hakone's mountains journey swift.\nViews of Fuji a painter's gift.\nCruise upon Lake Ashi serene and deep.\nWhere ancient legends softly sleep.\nArt galleries abound a feast for the soul.\nCraft workshops where skills make thee whole.\nReturn to Tokyo at twilight's grace.\nA city's charm finds its rightful place.\n\n**Day Four: Imperial Splendor and Gardens**\n\nTo the Imperial Palace's grounds we turn.\nA history rich lessons to learn.\nThen wander gardens serene and vast.\nWhere nature's beauty forever will last.\nGinza's boutiques a shopper's delight.\nLuxury finds flourish in dazzling light.\nDinner enjoy sushi fresh and bright.\nA culinary journey pure delight.\n\n**Day Five: Day Trip to Kamakura a Coastal Scene**\n\nTo Kamakura's shore we shall betake.\nGreat Buddha statue a sight to make.\nHase-dera temple a serene view.\nOf ocean waves forever true.\nExplore Tsurugaoka Hachimangu Shrine.\nA sacred space divinely fine.\nReturn to Tokyo with hearts full of glee.\nA day's adventure for thee to see.\n\n**Day Six: Markets and Modernity**\n\nTo Tsukiji Outer Market we shall roam.\nFresh seafood delights a taste of home.\nExplore Harajuku's fashion bold.\nYouthful trends stories to be told.\nMeiji Jingu Shrine a peaceful retreat.\nWhere nature's solace we shall meet.\nEvening find a jazz bar's gentle sound.\nMemories made on Japanese ground.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure with Gratitude**\n\nFarewell Japan a land of grace.\nMemories cherished time cannot erase.\nThy journey ends but not thy heart.\nFor Japan's beauty plays a vital part.\nReturn to thy home with spirits high.\nOf wonders seen beneath the sky.\nMay fortune smile upon thee evermore.\nUntil we meet on this distant shore.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.002059364225715399}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.2278481335670222e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.6396634578704834}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.00865234062075615}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.1442747265100479}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.1089370250701904}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.4855436682701111}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00016306500765495002}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.016425158828496933}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -2.017688512802124}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.2552969753742218}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.15951800346374512}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.07732073962688446}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.3420100510120392}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.1957845687866211}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.04925867170095444}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.03028869442641735}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.3520795404911041}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.13201427459716797}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.00201177760027349}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.24851661920547485}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.7265348434448242}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.08336272835731506}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.008851340040564537}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.000145067